WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.390
Listen: «fou». Now listen: «ouf».

2
00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.680
Same meaning: crazy.

3
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.880
So what happened between the two?

4
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:10.530
Now style. On one side,

5
00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.390
cheap new clothes, often bought online.

6
00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:15.150
On the other, «les friperies»,

7
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:17.260
second-hand clothes shops.

8
00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:23.000
In June 2026, Parliament adopted
a law against ultra-fast fashion.

9
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.180
Slang, style, screens: how
do young people in France

10
00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.840
build who they are?

11
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.110
In this mission, you'll map
what shapes an identity,

12
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.520
from family to your image online.

13
00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:37.940
Then you'll weigh fitting
in against standing out:

14
00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:40.920
«appartenir à un groupe»
or «se démarquer».

15
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.030
Your mission: find out
how young people in France

16
00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:45.320
build who they are.
